  <data name="OnboardingDesc1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>VoiceGarden is a free, open-source voice bridge that connects 20+ modern text-to-speech engines to any Windows application that supports SAPI 5 — including Grid 3, Mind Express, Balabolka, Tobii Communicator, and any app built on System.Speech.</value>
